    <bpmn:process id="W_W171" name="W171. Store Physical Security &amp; Yard Patrol Routine" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Hourly patrol requirement; or high-risk alert (storm, local unrest)
Frequency: Hourly (24/7)
Volume: Covers all 200 stores and 4 DCs
Owner: Store Security Lead
Participants: Security Guard, Store Manager
Source: workflow W171 — Store Physical Security &amp; Yard Patrol Routine</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W171_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W171_Lane1" name="Security Guard">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W171_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W171_Start3" name="Hourly patrol requirement; or high-risk alert (storm, local unrest)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W171_Task4" name="Patrol Start">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Patrol Start: Guard initiates patrol on handheld device/app; scans NFC tag at the Guard Post
Responsible (R): Security Guard
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W171_Task5" name="Perimeter Check">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Perimeter Check: Walk exterior walls; check for structural breaches, fence tampering, or unauthorized loitering
Responsible (R): Security Guard
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W171_Task6" name="Lumber Yard/Outdoor Inventory">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Lumber Yard/Outdoor Inventory: Verify seals on outdoor containers; check that bulky stock (cement, steel) is covered/secured; scan NFC tags at yard corners
Responsible (R): Security Guard
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W171_Task7" name="Utility &amp; Fire Check">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Utility &amp; Fire Check: Inspect fire pump room, generator set (check fuel/oil levels), and electrical sub-station for any leaks or abnormal noise
Responsible (R): Security Guard
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W171_Task8" name="Backroom/Receiving">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Backroom/Receiving: Verify that the receiving dock is locked and no staff are in restricted areas after-hours
Responsible (R): Security Guard
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W171_Task9" name="Digital Log">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Digital Log: Guard submits patrol report via app with photos of any &quot;Alert&quot; items; Store Manager receives instant notification for &quot;Critical&quot; issues
Responsible (R): Security Guard
Accountable (A): Store Mgr
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W171_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W171_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W171_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W171_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-260 (ensure controlled execution — Store Facility &amp; Safety (PA-07.2).) | - operational: depends on the Store Manager receiving and acting on alerts
Owner: Store Security Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
