    <bpmn:process id="W_W504" name="W504. Store-Level Digital Signage &amp; Content Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Content schedule update from HQ marketing; new promotional campaign; ad-hoc content change request from store
Frequency: Weekly content updates; campaign-based content changes (~6 major campaigns/year); ad-hoc changes as needed
Volume: ~10–15 content updates/month across 200 stores; ~50 screens per store × 200 stores = ~10,000 managed endpoints
Owner: Marketing Content Manager
Participants: Creative Team, Store Manager, IT Support
Source: workflow W504 — Store-Level Digital Signage &amp; Content Management</bpmn:documentation>
